    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_03",
      "hash64": "B85D8FDEF16F5CED",
      "text": "要挑战飞翔计时赛吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_04",
      "hash64": "B85D88DEF16F5108",
      "text": "要挑战哪条路线呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_05",
      "hash64": "B85D89DEF16F52BB",
      "text": "初级路线啊！\\n悠然自在地飞吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_06",
      "hash64": "B85D8ADEF16F546E",
      "text": "中级路线啊！\\n稳扎稳打地飞吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_07",
      "hash64": "B85D8BDEF16F5621",
      "text": "高级路线啊！\\n一鼓作气地飞吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_19",
      "hash64": "B86109DEF1726212",
      "text": "超级路线啊！\\n拼尽全力地飞吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_08",
      "hash64": "B85D84DEF16F4A3C",
      "text": "你需要借助坐骑宝可梦的飞行能力，\\n在巨蛋上空按路线飞行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_09",
      "hash64": "B85D85DEF16F4BEF",
      "text": "在限制时间内\\n到达终点，就算通过。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_10",
      "hash64": "B86112DEF172715D",
      "text": "如果钻过小磁怪的圆环\\n就会延长限制时间哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_002_follower_11",
